# Deploy AudioPlayer app after code changes

When you finish changes under the Android Gradle project at `AudioPlayer/`, run a full install on the connected USB device:

1. From PowerShell: `Set-Location "c:\Users\Volkr\Desktop\audioPlayer\AudioPlayer"; .\gradlew.bat installDebug`
2. Confirm the build reports `Installed on 1 device` (or fix adb/device issues if install fails).

Do this automatically at the end of the task whenever the Android app sources were modified, unless the user explicitly asks not to install.
